        <p class="mb-6 italic text-slate-700">{localize("I’ve tried many focus apps, but Mindful Guard is the most reliable app blocker for Android. The scheduled app blocking feature helps me stay focused during work hours, and I love that it’s privacy-friendly with no ads or tracking.")}</p>
        <div class="mt-auto">
          <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">{localize("Waseka Niha")}</p>
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400 mt-1">{localize("GOOGLE PLAY")}</p>
